// Plugin: no-raw-zustand-persist — zustand's `persist(` middleware may appear ONLY inside the two
// factory chokepoints (`state/create-entity-draft-store.ts`, `state/create-persisted-store.ts`).
// Each factory bakes the persist footguns a raw call site WILL hold wrong (UI-Gates §11.5 — 9 of 11
// neo stores shipped unversioned persists, partly IRREVERSIBLE once stale blobs reach users'
// localStorage): `partialize` to the persisted key · `version` + a TOTAL crash-proof `migrate` · the
// storage-key uniqueness registry. This gate IS `persist-shape-needs-version` + `persist-partialize-
// and-total-migrate`, enforced by chokepoint instead of by inspecting every call site.
// Device-local UI state that wants persistence (panel dock/collapse, focus toggle) goes through
// `createPersistedStore` (its factory-reviewed seam — the shell-layout store's home) — never a bare
// persist().
language js

`persist($_)` where {
  $filename <: r".*/packages/client/src/.*",
  $filename <: not or {
    r".*/packages/client/src/state/create-entity-draft-store\.ts$",
    r".*/packages/client/src/state/create-persisted-store\.ts$",
    r".*\.test\.tsx?$"
  },
  register_diagnostic(span=$program, message="raw zustand persist() outside the draft-store factory — persistence footguns (partialize / version+total-migrate / key uniqueness) are baked into createEntityDraftStore; use it (or extend it), never a bare persist. See UI-Gates-and-Lessons.md §11.5.")
}
